n\nThe httpDispatcher flow: handlers run through httpSystemRpms first (system RPMs, run before auth check — v6 = httpSystemRpms[v2]). Wait — look at httpDispatcher again:\n\n```\ndo {\n  while (1) {\n    v6 = httpSystemRpms[v2];\n    if (!v6) {  // -> method list search + auth check via sub_425CB8\n      ...\n     ","stream":true,"block":0}

