on (inherited from overflow) become the \"icon\" path arg → might be used in realpath/strcpy into a file path → could lead to arbitrary file access. Interesting but messy.\n\nGiven v12 is used as URL query parsing buffer in SendResp_dlnafile/SendResp_thumbnail (","stream":true,"block":0}

